Package: rootbroker
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Rootbroker Maintainers <31204393+Chang-LL@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: sudo, systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/Chang-LL/rootbroker
Description: human-approved root command broker for local AI agents
 Rootbroker lets an isolated local AI agent request exact root commands through
 a separate human approval socket. Installation of this carrier package does
 not configure or start the root broker; run rootbroker-setup explicitly.
